<title>UK: All six Brent dates turning wet five o'clocked.</title>
<headline>All six Brent dates turning wet five o'clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five Brent dates turning wet on Friday were confirmed five o'clocked and a sixth clocking was in dispute, trade sources said.</p>
<p>Statoil, Texaco and J.P. Morgan were reportedly clocked on Feb 1-3 loading cargoes with one Feb 2-4 cargo in dispute and one clocked. Stasco were clocked on a Feb 3-5 stem.</p>
<p>--Colin Wooster, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
